                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Item Level Defect Rate (Gross)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>: Absolute(sum of on hand qty of targeted SKUs- sum of units counted  of targeted SKUs)/ sum of on hand qty of trageted SKUs
</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Share of Compliance </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>: stores with compliant sample size count / all stores that had cycle counts</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Units Discrepancy (Net)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>: sum of on hand qty of targeted SKUs - total units counted</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
