                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>: sum of absolute units discrepancy</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Total Adjustments (Units)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>: sum of stock adjustments triggered by the batch count</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Total Adjustments (Value)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>: sum of all adjustments per SKU * SKU&apos;s WAC in Euro or local currency</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
